nard","Damara Reilly","Mane Rich Andrew","Robert Dolan","Brian Catalano","Tangelia Rouse","Don Chastain","Cody Estes","India King","Erin Carufel","Margaret Easley","Wesley Leong","John David Conti","DaJuan Johnson","Daniel Graves","Darlene Kardon","Julia Sanford","Marcy Goldman","Sheila Wills","Bob Rumnock","James Curreri","Julie Pop","Michael Hobert","Lou George","Phoebe Dorin","Darren Hanvey","Donald Sage Mackay","Daniel Edward Mora","Lou Saliba","Josh Elliott","Katie O'Rourke","Dougald Park","Hira Ambrosino","Jeffrey Scott Kelly","Dayna Devon","Gary Kraus","Eric Artell","Deonte Gordon","Andy Pessoa","Terrance Christopher Jones","Carol Hickey","Richard Livingston","Kelli Kirkland","Brian Kaiser","Peter A. Hulne","Hannah Storm","Peter Choi","D. Elliot Woods","Timothy Starks","Richard Cansino","James Ritz","Jack Angel","Cole Williams","Ellerine Harding","Matthew J. Evans","Brennan Louie","Petra Sprecher","Derek Miller","Lela Lee","Jeff LaPensee","Chad Broskey","Bergen Williams","Toni Ann Rossi","John Valdetero","Big Bank Hank","Master Gee","Wonder Mike","Frank Encarnacao","Paige Peterson","Sonal Shah","David Doty","Sloan Robinson","Yolanda Snowball","Portia Dawson","Scott Rabideau","Paul Kwo","Eric Leviton","Kevin Clash","Mary Gillis","Henry LeBlanc","Jessica Wright","Hunter Huston","Azalea Davila","Vanessa Bayer","Joel Kim Booster","Jacob Dudman","David Gridley","Layla Mohammadi","Anna Maria Horsford","Matt Rife","Helenna Santos","Eddie Leavy","X Mayo","Meagen Fay","Alan Blumenfeld","Henry Mah","Amanda Morrow","Ava Bunn","Lisa Gilroy","Kirsten Vangsness","Andy Ridings","Larry Marko","Michael Alaimo","Lyla Graham","Logan Fields"],"screenwriters":["Gabrielle Allan","Bonnie Sikowitz","Eric Weinberg","Hadley Davis","Neil Goldman","Garrett Donovan","Rich Eustis","David Feinberg","Astro","Brian Avenet-Bradley","Ken Whittingham","Lon Zimmet","Justin Spitzer","Tim Hobert","Ryan A. Levin","Matt Tarses","Bill Lawrence","Prentice Penny","Aseem Batra","Leila Strachan","Janae Bakken","Angela Nissel","Dan Rubin","Mark Stegemann","Josh Bycel","Bill Callahan","Alessia Costantini","Will Berson","Kevin Biegel","Eren Celeboglu","Debra Fordham","Andy Schwartz","Dave Tennant","Kevin Etten","Tad Quill","Michael Hobert","Mathew Harawitz","Amy Pocha","Seth Cohen"],"cinematographers":["John Inwood","Dave Perkal","Andrew Rawson","Richard W. Davis","Richard Quinlan","Stephen Jackson"],"composers":["Michael Spiller","Jan Stevens","Jamie Jackson","Waz"],"reviews":[{"author":"Džany","text":"Komediální sitcomy byli vždycky velkou částí mého'diváckého života'a tenhle se mi vryl do paměti velmi dobře. Seriál nabitý vtipem a nezapomenutelnými hláškami, které se Dr. Coxovi, ale hlavně Údržbářovi neustále hrnou z pusy. Osobně považuji právě Údržbáře za nejlepší postavu celého Scrubs, která mě každou svojí větou rozesměje. Přidejte k tomu JD, Turka, Todda a Rowdyho a máte vyhráno. U mě za100%s tím, že díl s úžasnou cameo rolí Colina Farrella je minimálně za120%(09.06.2010)","stars":5},{"author":"ladko","text":"Sitcom ako má byť. Janitor pobaví vždy keď sa objaví na scéne, rovnako ako JD. A skvelý právnik Ted:)Nesedí mi tam jedine Elliot, ale to vôbec nezráža hodnotu tohto seriálu. Tu spomínané trápne fórky som si ani nevšimol-asi preto, že na jeden taký pripadá aspoň 5 skvelých fórov, pri ktorých som sa v každej časti rezal smiechom. Janitor:\"Girl problems, huh?\" JD:\"How'd you know?\" Janitor:\"You look worried. And you're a girl.\"(16.01.2008)","stars":5},{"author":"Ender66","text":"Scrubs mi prirástol k srdci. Z mojho rebríčka naj seriálov nejde o najvtipnejšiu vec (tou je asi Red Dwarf), ani najoriginálnejšiu (Dead like me), ani nútiacu Vás zamyslieť sa nad niečím hlbším (Band of brothers, Mash). Na druhú stranu ide podľa mňa o mňamózny koktejl všetkého vyššie menovaného. Postavy sú výborne napísané a zahrané a niektoré hlášky patria do klenotnice (najmä údržbárové a doktora Coxa a Kelsa). Nad všetkými ale stojí môj obľúcenec Zach, ktorého mám rád už od prvého filmu s ním čo som videl (Garden state) a ktorý ma ešte ani raz neskalmal:-). Jeho sympatický ňouma s bohatým vnútorným svetom je asi jeho najlepšou kreáciou. K tomu pridajte výbornú hudobnú stránku a máme tu ďalšiu 10:-).(17.10.2007)","stars":5}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-bba197b5-eb03-4a09-b5f6-f04c053471d7"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/93062-scrubs-dokturci/prehled/","csfd_id":93062,"root_id":93062,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":11,"episode_count":200,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[{"season_no":10,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":null,"title":"Moje romantická komedie (S10E03)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":null,"title":"Moje pokerová tvář (S10E04)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":null,"title":"Můj anděl (S10E05)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":null,"title":"Moje VIP (S10E06)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":7,"vod_date":null,"title":"My Best Friend’s Barbecue (S10E07)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":null,"title":"My Odds (S10E08)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":10,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":null,"title":"My Celebration (S10E09)","platforms":["Disney+"]}]}